{"id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","title":"Transitive Set","display":"df-transitive-set — Transitive Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-transitive-set","aliases":["58-df-transitive-set"],"display":"df-transitive-set — Transitive Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-set]]","[[58-df-subset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-transitive-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-transitive-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-transitive-set — Transitive Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d35b78cf8312c12b\" href=\"?note=d35b78cf8312c12b\" title=\"58-df-subset\">58-df-subset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Set}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Set}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq\">\\(\\subseteq\\)</span> 由原依赖定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S,\\mathrm{Trans}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S,\\mathrm{Trans}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> 为下式定义的同一传递集谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\subseteq X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\subseteq X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Trans}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>一元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}\\)</span> 是传递集谓词的兼容名称；与二元关系的传递性谓词按元数区分。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-subset","status":"resolved","id":"d35b78cf8312c12b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-subset]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Set}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\subseteq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S,\\mathrm{Trans}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Set}_S(X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\subseteq X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trans}(X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trans}","display":false}],"bytes":822,"backlinks":[{"id":"b6ec5105268243bd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Trans